<h2 class="mt-12">Peak season readiness for replenishment</h2>
<ol>
<li>Halt replenishment edits ahead of the peak window.</li>
<li>Replenishment QA spans purchase, refund, and case paths.</li>
<li>Verify replenishment suppression clears recent buyers and open returns.</li>
<li>For replenishment, grow control samples ahead of volume.</li>
<li>For replenishment, pre-commit text timing and frequency limits.</li>
<li>Replenishment billing checked on peak math.</li>
<li>Cover replenishment complaint and bounce review daily.</li>
<li>Replenishment undo paths recorded pre-campaign.</li>
</ol>
<p>Replenishment programs stay calm when the quarterly review is calendared pre-launch: suppression, discount caps, and escalation contacts for replenishment live in writing from week one, so successors inherit process, not memory.</p>
<p>Quarterly replenishment honesty pays: log shipped replenishment flows, suppression calls, margin kept, and broken assumptions. The replenishment paper trail converts solo judgment into institutional knowledge.</p>
